      "comment": "GERONIMO DASH (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 2.5 lengths third (24.44) over 425m at this track. Top prospect. ASSUMED MISSING (4) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Healesville over 300m behind Downer Road (17.42) in a Maiden. Better than last start and can bounce back. ROCKY CABANG (8) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (24.74) at this track. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ASTON TAURUS (5) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
